{"status":"ready","content":"## Long Division: 123456789012345 ÷ 98765\r\n\r\n### Setting Up\r\n\r\nI need to divide 123,456,789,012,345 by 98,765.\r\n\r\n### Finding the Quotient\r\n\r\n**Estimate:** 123456789012345 ÷ 98765 ≈ 123456789012345 ÷ 100000 ≈ 1,234,567,890\r\n\r\nLet me compute 98765 × 1,249,aginemos... let me be systematic.\r\n\r\n**Step 1:** Estimate quotient ≈ 1,249,999,xxx\r\n\r\nLet me try: 98765 × 1,250,000,000 = 98765 × 1.25 × 10⁹\r\n- 98765 × 1,000,000,000 = 98,765,000,000,000\r\n- 98765 × 250,000,000 = 24,691,250,000,000\r\n- Sum = **123,456,250,000,000**\r\n\r\n**Remainder so far:** 123,456,789,012,345 − 123,456,250,000,000 = **539,012,345**\r\n\r\n**Step 2:** 539,012,345 ÷ 98,765 ≈ 5,457\r\n\r\n- 98765 × 5,000 = 493,825,000\r\n- 98765 × 5,400 = 533,331,000\r\n- 98765 × 5,457 = ?\r\n  - 98765 × 5,000 = 493,825,000\r\n  - 98765 × 400 = 39,506,000\r\n  - 98765 × 57 = 5,629,605\r\n  - Sum = **538,960,605**\r\n\r\n**Remainder:** 539,012,345 − 538,960,605 = **51,740**\r\n\r\n### Result\r\n\r\n- **Quotient = 1,250,005,457**\r\n- **Remainder = 51,740**\r\n\r\n### Verification\r\n\r\n98765 × 1,250,005,457 + 51,740\r\n= 123,456,250,000,000 + 538,960,605 + 51,740\r\n= 123,456,789,012,345 ✓\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Quotient: 1,250,005,457**\r\n**Remainder: 51,740**\r\n","path":"responses/claude-sonnet-4-6/large-division.txt","size":1202,"mtime":1778577310}